    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66817" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετανά-στᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>devastated by
			migrations</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἑλλὰς οὐχ ὑπ᾽ ἀνθρώπων μόνον
					γινομένη μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ocell.
					3.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having departed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατέρων μετανάστατος ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.513
				</span></i>
			.</div>
